Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.87,0:00:08.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道你不希望我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.77,0:00:11.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but I do and I'm so excited for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.77,0:00:11.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我知道了  我真为你感到高兴
