Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.97,0:00:12.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.84,0:00:14.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Monica's pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.84,0:00:14.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莫妮卡怀孕了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.08,0:00:19.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God. Is that why you guys had to get married?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.08,0:00:19.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊  所以说你们两个是奉子成婚
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.78,0:00:21.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Guys, I'm not pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.78,0:00:21.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没有怀孕
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.77,0:00:23.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, slow swimmers?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.77,0:00:23.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}精子游得太慢了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.06,0:00:28.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?! What do you mean? You're not pregnant?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.06,0:00:28.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么  你这是什么意思  你没有怀孕吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.75,0:00:30.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You didn't tell anybody I was, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.75,0:00:30.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你没跑去跟别人说我怀孕了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.62,0:00:31.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.62,0:00:31.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.09,0:00:34.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.09,0:00:34.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我马上回来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.56,0:00:38.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why don't we get a shot of Monica and the bloody soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.56,0:00:38.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们来拍张莫妮卡跟英勇士兵的合照
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.09,0:00:41.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}About that, Joey, you have to change before the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.09,0:00:41.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}说起这点  乔伊你得在婚宴开始前换套衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.09,0:00:43.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't. I don't have any other clothes here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.09,0:00:43.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行  我没带衣服来换
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.15,0:00:44.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Find some, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.15,0:00:44.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那就拜托去找套衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.62,0:00:48.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anything that doesn't say, "I died tragically in France."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.62,0:00:48.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别再穿着"我不幸战死于法国"的衣服了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.82,0:00:51.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why don't we see the bride and the groom, and the bridesmaids.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.82,0:00:51.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们让新人跟伴娘们合照一些照片吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.01,0:00:57.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Mon, why'd you tell the guys that you weren't pregnant?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.01,0:00:57.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莫妮卡  你为什么告诉大家你没有怀孕
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.29,0:00:58.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.29,0:00:58.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为我本来就没怀
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.48,0:01:01.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We found your tests. If you're not pregnant...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.48,0:01:01.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们发现了你的验孕棒  如果你没有怀孕...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.59,0:01:08.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...it's because I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.59,0:01:08.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是因为我怀孕了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.06,0:01:12.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you talking about? Phoebe, what are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.06,0:01:12.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在胡说什么  菲比  你在胡说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.16,0:01:15.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, I am with child.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.16,0:01:15.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  我怀了孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.12,0:01:19.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I didn't want to say anything because it's your day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.12,0:01:19.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不想说  因为今天是你们的大喜之日
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.66,0:01:21.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I didn't wanna steal your thunder.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.66,0:01:21.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不想抢了你的风采
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.34,0:01:23.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So you told people I was pregnant?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.34,0:01:23.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}于是你就告诉大家我怀孕了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.04,0:01:26.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Does this look like a conversation I want to remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.04,0:01:26.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你觉得这种对话  我会想要记录下来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.22,0:01:29.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who's the father? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.22,0:01:29.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}孩子他爸是谁  对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.28,0:01:32.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.28,0:01:32.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不能说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.36,0:01:34.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why? Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.36,0:01:34.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么   为什么不行
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.44,0:01:37.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't say because he's famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.44,0:01:37.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不能说  因为他是名人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.76,0:01:40.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God. Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.76,0:01:40.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊  是哪个名人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.30,0:01:44.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Phoebe, come on, you have to tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.30,0:01:44.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比  你得告诉我们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.23,0:01:47.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, okay, it's James Brolin.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.23,0:01:47.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  是詹姆斯.布洛林
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.09,0:01:51.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}James Brolin is the father of my baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.09,0:01:51.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}詹姆斯.布洛林是孩子的爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.28,0:01:55.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}As in Barbra Streisand's husband James Brolin?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.28,0:01:55.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你指的是芭芭拉·史翠珊的老公詹姆斯·布洛林
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.91,0:01:57.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.91,0:01:57.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.81,0:01:59.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, he never said that to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.81,0:01:59.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他从没跟我提过这事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.40,0:02:03.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Friends S08E01 The One After I Do
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.40,0:02:03.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《老友记》  第八季  第1集  在说了"我愿意"之后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.27,0:02:39.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Monica, if you step away,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.27,0:02:39.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莫妮卡  请你先到旁边
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.51,0:02:41.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}we'll get Chandler and the bridesmaids. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.51,0:02:41.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们要拍钱德勒跟伴娘的合照  好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.72,0:02:43.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How about just the bridesmaids?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.72,0:02:43.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}何不只拍伴娘的合照呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.09,0:02:46.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, I am the groom. I was told it was a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.09,0:02:46.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是新郎  听说这个角色很重要
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.76,0:02:48.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It is. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.76,0:02:48.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错  对
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.84,0:02:51.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.84,0:02:51.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.86,0:02:54.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you for that. I just can't deal with this just quite yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.86,0:02:54.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你  我现在还没有办法处理这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.96,0:02:56.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So instead you told me Monica was pregnant?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.96,0:02:56.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}于是你告诉我莫妮卡怀孕了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.98,0:02:59.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You said she was. I just didn't disagree with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.98,0:02:59.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是你说她怀孕了  我只是没反驳你罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.70,0:03:01.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sneaky. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.70,0:03:01.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真狡猾  是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.92,0:03:03.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Smile, ladies!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.92,0:03:03.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}笑一个  姑娘们
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.73,0:03:08.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}By the way, James Brolin? I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.73,0:03:08.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}詹姆斯.布洛林  亏你想得出  我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.52,0:03:09.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I could only think of two names:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.52,0:03:09.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我脑海里只蹦出两个人名
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.65,0:03:12.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Him and Ed Begley Jr. And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.65,0:03:12.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他跟小艾德·贝格利
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.32,0:03:15.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I remembered he's gay, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.32,0:03:15.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我记得他是男同志  所以...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.62,0:03:18.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ed Begley Jr. is not gay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.62,0:03:18.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}小艾德·贝格利不是男同志
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.66,0:03:19.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.66,0:03:19.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.14,0:03:31.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.14,0:03:31.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.03,0:03:34.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ladies and gentlemen, it gives me great pleasure to introduce to you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.03,0:03:34.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}先生们女士们  我非常荣幸地
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.36,0:03:38.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}for the very first time: Mr. And Mrs. Chandler Bing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.36,0:03:38.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}首次向大家介绍  钱德勒·宾夫妇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.69,0:03:46.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Before we go out there, I got a present for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.69,0:03:46.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}到舞池前  我要送你一份礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.68,0:03:49.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Honey, I'm not gonna put my hand in your pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.68,0:03:49.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我才不要把手伸到你的口袋里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.63,0:03:53.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. I've been taking dancing lessons. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.63,0:03:53.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是  我去上了舞蹈课  什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.43,0:03:54.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}For the last six weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.43,0:03:54.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我上了六星期的舞蹈课
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.52,0:03:57.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I wanted this to be a moment you'd never forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.52,0:03:57.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我希望这一刻能让你永生难忘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.07,0:03:59.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That is so sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.07,0:03:59.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的是太体贴了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.25,0:04:03.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So would you care to join me in our first dance as husband and wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.25,0:04:03.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你愿不愿意以夫妻的身份跟我跳第一支舞
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.36,0:04:04.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.36,0:04:04.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我愿意
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.97,0:04:10.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.97,0:04:10.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.10,0:04:12.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's these new shoes, they're all slippery.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.10,0:04:12.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的新鞋太滑了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.58,0:04:15.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you gonna be able to do this? Not well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.58,0:04:15.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你还能跳舞吗  不太行
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.53,0:04:25.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, the good news is, I don't think anyone's looking at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.53,0:04:25.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好消息是我觉得没人在看我们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.07,0:04:29.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So are you ready to talk about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.07,0:04:29.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你准备好要谈谈了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.20,0:04:31.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.20,0:04:31.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.14,0:04:34.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.14,0:04:34.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.01,0:04:37.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.01,0:04:37.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不要谈
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.03,0:04:40.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We'll talk about something else then. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.03,0:04:40.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们来谈别的事  谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.56,0:04:42.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who's the father?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.56,0:04:42.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}孩子他爸是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.06,0:04:44.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Honey, I haven't told him yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.06,0:04:44.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}亲爱的  我还没有告诉他
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.95,0:04:48.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...so, until I do, I don't think I should tell anybody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.95,0:04:48.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我打算先告诉他  再告诉其他人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.13,0:04:50.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. That's fine. That's fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.13,0:04:50.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没关系  那很合理
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.40,0:04:53.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is it Tag? Phoebe!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.40,0:04:53.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是泰格吗  菲比
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.84,0:04:55.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, I'm sorry. I'll stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.84,0:04:55.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  对不起  我不问了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.03,0:04:57.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is it Ross? It's Ross, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.03,0:04:57.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是罗斯吗  是罗斯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.88,0:05:00.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God, it's Joey! Stop it. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.88,0:05:00.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊  是乔伊  别说了  好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.82,0:05:03.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am not gonna tell you until I tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.82,0:05:03.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在告诉他之前我不会告诉你的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.74,0:05:05.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}At least we know it's a him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.74,0:05:05.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}至少我们知道他是个男的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.24,0:05:13.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, sweet Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.24,0:05:13.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.33,0:05:16.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry, okay? I went down to the gift shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.33,0:05:16.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起  好吗  我跑到礼品店
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.75,0:05:18.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was either this or a bathrobe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.75,0:05:18.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那里只卖这个跟浴袍
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.23,0:05:21.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look. What's more important: the way I'm dressed,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.23,0:05:21.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你更看重哪点呢  是我的穿着打扮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.09,0:05:22.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}or being with you on your special day?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.09,0:05:22.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还是我能出席你的婚礼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.89,0:05:26.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Honey, I'm not gonna even pretend I was listening. Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.89,0:05:26.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我都懒得假装刚才在听你说话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.80,0:05:36.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm Ross, I don't believe we met.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.80,0:05:36.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是罗斯  我们应该没有见过
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.10,0:05:37.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm Monica's older brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.10,0:05:37.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是莫妮卡的哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.81,0:05:40.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi, I'm Mona from her restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.81,0:05:40.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是她在餐厅的同事蒙娜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.86,0:05:44.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello, Mona from her restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.86,0:05:44.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好  她在餐厅的同事蒙娜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.52,0:05:52.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mona. What a beautiful name.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.52,0:05:52.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}蒙娜  这个名字很美
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.20,0:05:54.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You think so? I always kind of hated it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.20,0:05:54.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是吗  我一直都很讨厌这个名字
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.68,0:05:56.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on! Mona Lisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.68,0:05:56.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}少来了  蒙娜丽莎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.47,0:05:58.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mona...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.47,0:05:58.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}蒙娜...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.36,0:06:01.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...Llegglachen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.36,0:06:01.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}利格拉齐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.12,0:06:04.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The famous botanist.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.12,0:06:04.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她是着名的植物学家
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.71,0:06:08.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, no, she's... Well, she's dead now, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.71,0:06:08.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不  她...她死了  但是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.75,0:06:14.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Supposedly she was once quite the hottie of the plant world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.75,0:06:14.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她曾经是植物学界最性感的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.81,0:06:15.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.81,0:06:15.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.80,0:06:19.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See, I never knew about her. Linda Llegglachen...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.80,0:06:19.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我根本不认识她  琳达·利格拉齐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.34,0:06:27.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, what table are you at?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.34,0:06:27.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在几号桌
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.50,0:06:29.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.50,0:06:29.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.11,0:06:33.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good. Now there'll be someone there who likes my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.11,0:06:33.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很好  那就有个喜欢我名字的人跟我同桌了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.29,0:06:34.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, there will.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.29,0:06:34.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  没错
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.08,0:06:43.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Guess what, Molly Gilbert.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.08,0:06:43.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}猜怎么着  莫莉·吉柏特
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.97,0:06:47.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You've just been bumped up to table one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.97,0:06:47.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你刚刚被踢到一号桌了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.25,0:06:49.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And if it's all right with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.25,0:06:49.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你没有意见的话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.13,0:06:52.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll take your place at table six.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.13,0:06:52.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要代替你坐到六号桌
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.07,0:06:54.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Martin Llegglachen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.07,0:06:54.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}马丁·利格拉齐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.11,0:06:59.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's better. Now, just bend your arms a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.11,0:06:59.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样好多了  现在双手弯曲
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.98,0:07:01.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now look straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.98,0:07:01.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}眼睛看前方
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.71,0:07:05.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, this time I want you to really put your ass into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.71,0:07:05.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这次我要你臀部用力顶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.70,0:07:11.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Chandler, darling, look, my date has finally arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.70,0:07:11.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}钱德勒  你看我的男伴终于来了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.33,0:07:13.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'd like you to meet Dennis Phillips.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.33,0:07:13.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这位是丹尼斯·菲利浦斯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.27,0:07:15.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Congratulations. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.27,0:07:15.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}恭喜  谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.12,0:07:16.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, Dennis is a dear old friend...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.12,0:07:16.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}丹尼斯是我的老朋友...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.96,0:07:19.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and a fantastic lover.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.96,0:07:19.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还是个绝佳情人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.44,0:07:22.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Bravo, Dennis. Thanks for pleasing my mother so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.44,0:07:22.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太棒了  丹尼斯  谢谢你取悦我老妈
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.69,0:07:27.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm so sorry I missed the ceremony. I was stuck at auditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.69,0:07:27.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉我没赶上婚礼  我在忙着试镜
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.76,0:07:31.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, Dennis is directing a new Broadway show.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.76,0:07:31.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  丹尼斯正在执导一出百老汇新戏
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.00,0:07:33.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't believe we've met. Joey Tribbiani.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.00,0:07:33.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们应该还没见过  乔伊·崔比安尼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.42,0:07:34.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dennis Phillips.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.42,0:07:34.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}丹尼斯·菲利浦斯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.23,0:07:36.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've admired your work for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.23,0:07:36.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}多年来我一直很欣赏你的作品
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.70,0:07:39.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You've done some really amazing stuff. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.70,0:07:39.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的作品真的很棒  谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.76,0:07:41.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you'll excuse me, I'm gonna go get myself a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.76,0:07:41.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}失陪一下  我要去喝点东西
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.56,0:07:42.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll be back in a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.56,0:07:42.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我马上回来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.71,0:07:45.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dennis Phillips. That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.71,0:07:45.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}丹尼斯·菲利浦斯  真是太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.70,0:07:46.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How did you guys meet?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.70,0:07:46.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们怎么认识的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.93,0:07:48.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, it's a funny story.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.93,0:07:48.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那个故事说起来有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.73,0:07:51.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Funny, "haha"? Or funny:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.73,0:07:51.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是惹人发笑  还是惨不忍睹
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.21,0:08:01.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you. Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.21,0:08:01.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢  非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.41,0:08:03.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If everyone will please take your seats,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.41,0:08:03.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大家请坐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.25,0:08:04.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}dinner will be served.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.25,0:08:04.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}晚宴马上开始
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.02,0:08:21.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I thought you were at table six. No. Nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.02,0:08:21.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我以为你在六号桌  不  是九号桌
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.98,0:08:28.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See, before, when you showed it to me, you held it that way...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.98,0:08:28.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你刚刚给我看时是那样拿的...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.16,0:08:31.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...which was misleading.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.16,0:08:31.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我被你误导了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.24,0:08:44.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.24,0:08:44.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.30,0:08:53.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Will you see if your mom
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.30,0:08:53.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你能请你妈把我的履历表
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.32,0:08:55.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}can give my resume to Dennis Phillips?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.32,0:08:55.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拿给丹尼斯·菲利浦斯吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.30,0:08:58.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If I could get in a Broadway show, then I would've done it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.30,0:08:58.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只要能演百老汇舞台剧  我就什么戏都演过了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.25,0:09:00.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Film, television and theater.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.25,0:09:00.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}电影  电视剧跟舞台剧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.29,0:09:01.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The only thing left would be radio.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.29,0:09:01.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}唯一的例外是广播剧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.75,0:09:03.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But that's just for ugly people.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.75,0:09:03.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是留给丑八怪演的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.17,0:09:08.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What size shoes do you wear? 11, 11 half.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.17,0:09:08.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你穿几号鞋  11号  11号半
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.50,0:09:10.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Great. My shoes give me a problem on the dance floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.50,0:09:10.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的鞋子太滑没办法跳舞
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.93,0:09:12.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can I borrow your boots from your costume?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.93,0:09:12.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的戏靴能借我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.64,0:09:16.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't really even know where I left those. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.64,0:09:16.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真不知道把靴子丢到哪里去了  抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.95,0:09:19.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Those aren't 11 half.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.95,0:09:19.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的脚不可能是11号半
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.73,0:09:21.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, fine, I'm a 7!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.73,0:09:21.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  我穿七号的鞋子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.21,0:09:23.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have surprisingly small feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.21,0:09:23.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的脚出奇的小
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.95,0:09:25.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But the rest of me is good. I'll show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.95,0:09:25.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但其它部份都很大  我可以露给你看
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.12,0:09:31.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can you believe Phoebe got pregnant?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.12,0:09:31.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你能相信菲比怀孕了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.11,0:09:33.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what, honey? Let's not talk about that right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.11,0:09:33.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在别谈那件事了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.99,0:09:35.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is so huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.99,0:09:35.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这可是爆炸性新闻
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.31,0:09:37.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sure, but as big as your wedding?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.31,0:09:37.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错  但那也没有你的婚礼重要
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.66,0:09:39.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of course not. Nothing is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.66,0:09:39.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然  我的婚礼最重要了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.00,0:09:44.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Between me and you, in this day and age...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.00,0:09:44.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}说句悄悄话  到了这个时代...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.59,0:09:46.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...how dumb do you have to be to get pregnant?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.59,0:09:46.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁会笨到让自己怀孕
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.42,0:09:49.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know? Sometimes you can do everything right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.42,0:09:49.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有时候你该做的都做了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.06,0:09:51.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Everyone wears what they're supposed to wear...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.06,0:09:51.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}双方都戴上了该戴的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.17,0:09:53.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and one of those little guys just gets through.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.17,0:09:53.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但有个小家伙还是攻过了城池
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.01,0:09:55.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.01,0:09:55.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么会呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.78,0:09:58.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know. Maybe they have tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.78,0:09:58.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道  或许它们有什么工具
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.81,0:10:03.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I talked to her, and she's definitely gonna have the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.81,0:10:03.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我跟她谈过  她要把孩子生下来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.22,0:10:05.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She said she's gonna raise it on her own.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.22,0:10:05.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她说她要自己抚养孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.84,0:10:09.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, maybe that's really brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.84,0:10:09.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许那真的很勇敢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.65,0:10:12.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe. I just hope she realizes how hard it's gonna be.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.65,0:10:12.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许吧  我只是希望她知道那有多辛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.16,0:10:18.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe she hasn't really thought it through that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.16,0:10:18.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许她没有想那么多
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.60,0:10:21.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, there's a lot to think about.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.60,0:10:21.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}的确有很多事需要考虑
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.46,0:10:25.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How is she gonna handle this financially?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.46,0:10:25.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她要怎么解决经济问题
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.16,0:10:26.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How is she gonna juggle work?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.16,0:10:26.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她怎么能应付得了工作
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.56,0:10:28.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Does she realize she's not gonna have a date again
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.56,0:10:28.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她知道她在未来的18年内
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.97,0:10:31.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}for the next, like, 18 years?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.97,0:10:31.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}都没法再去约会了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.38,0:10:36.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.38,0:10:36.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.03,0:10:40.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.03,0:10:40.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.46,0:10:46.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm just thinking about Phoebe. Poor, knockedup Phoebe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.46,0:10:46.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是想到菲比怀了孕  可怜的菲比
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.96,0:10:49.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Champagne?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.96,0:10:49.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要喝香槟吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.21,0:10:51.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yes! Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.21,0:10:51.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好的  谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.90,0:11:07.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's actually how the French drink it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.90,0:11:07.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}法国人都是那样喝香槟的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.32,0:11:18.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I just got off the phone with my lover James Brolin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.32,0:11:18.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我刚刚跟我的情人詹姆斯·布洛林通过电话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.58,0:11:20.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.58,0:11:20.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.39,0:11:23.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes. Apparently, he is married to some singer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.39,0:11:23.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他显然娶了一个歌手
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.26,0:11:26.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But he said he'd leave her for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.26,0:11:26.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但他说他会为了我离开她
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.86,0:11:29.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I said, "James, James Brolin, are you sure?"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.86,0:11:29.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我说"詹姆斯·布洛林  你确定吗"
