Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.10,0:11:38.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}装得那么费劲干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.50,0:11:43.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How do you feel? I don't know. I don't know how I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.50,0:11:43.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你感觉如何  我不知道我有什么感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.14,0:11:44.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is all happening so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.14,0:11:44.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一切都发生得太快了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.49,0:11:47.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have to make all these decisions that I don't wanna make.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.49,0:11:47.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我得做出许多我不想做的决定
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.07,0:11:50.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Someone just take this away from me!
