Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.84,0:11:54.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Calm down. Maybe you're not pregnant. What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.84,0:11:54.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}冷静点  或许你没有怀孕  什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.09,0:11:55.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When I got pregnant with the triplets,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.09,0:11:55.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我怀三胞胎的时候
