Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.39,0:12:00.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  或许是假警报
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.68,0:12:02.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you sure you peed on the stick right?
