Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.26,0:12:10.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是说在没有百分之百确定前别大惊小怪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.32,0:12:13.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, I'll take it again when I get home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.32,0:12:13.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  我回家后会再验一次
