Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.68,0:12:20.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll run out and get you one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.68,0:12:20.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我去帮你买验孕棒
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.70,0:12:22.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You girls are so great.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.70,0:12:22.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们真是太好了
