Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.02,0:12:26.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她不肯告诉我们
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.27,0:12:27.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on! It's my wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.27,0:12:27.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快说吧  这可是我的婚礼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.85,0:12:29.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That could be my present!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.85,0:12:29.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你可以把这当做是送我的礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.51,0:12:32.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just gave you peeing on a stick.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.51,0:12:32.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我刚刚答应为了你验孕
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.16,0:12:34.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See, this is why you register.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.16,0:12:34.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看吧  所以一定要做礼物登记
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.42,0:12:45.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was the chair again. Okay? I'm not doing it!
